{"title":"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 17","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is the solution to inequality <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/6/e96d5ed2457e1ff87c7316152742ed0b64e8b175.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|3x-4|\\ge 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"96\" height=\"20\" /> using interval notation?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/4/244de73fd4dd4b579c6714a431945dd4dc655f8d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\  \\left[-\\frac{4}{3},\\,\\frac{4}{3}\\right] \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\  \\left(-\\infty,-\\frac{8}{3}\\right)\\cup(4,\\infty) \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\  \\left(-\\infty,-\\frac{4}{3}\\right]\\cup[4,\\infty) \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\  \\left(-\\infty,-4\\right]\\cup\\left[\\frac{4}{3},\\infty\\right) \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\  \\left[\\frac{4}{3},\\,\\frac{8}{3}\\right] \\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"965\" height=\"45\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For the absolute value to be greater than or equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/8/ab8cb21651922efa9f65043000d8eedd6f946df4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3x - 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"53\" height=\"15\" /> must either be greater than or equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> or be less than or equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/2/922c4f40c55a550006c796efcd63a7828ecfd95f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-8$\" width=\"22\" height=\"12\" />.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/a/64aa66e5aedaab56c42cdffd2acd6bfc66ad2f3d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3x - 4 \\geq 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"86\" height=\"16\" />, then:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/2/182258fff827f247aaa7d714ab3a38b1b21345e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3x \\geq 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"64\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/0/86038428f86385226f9ea7e0bbbb0d684317fcdc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\geq \\frac{12}{3} = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"92\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/2/c3244eb6e1810254d44a2ab378c48583ebcfcca1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3x - 4 \\leq -8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"100\" height=\"16\" />, then:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/d/bcd1312b76dc492e2c5cd8c42e9dc0606c157fb1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3x \\leq -4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"69\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/6/5364bdb3969475a4b69470547dab6357c414374f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\leq \\frac{-4}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"64\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>This matches <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/8/1f8a04179d3b045ac00c5fc2e7bc92cf51b83920.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf {(C) } \\left(-\\infty,-\\frac{4}{3}\\right]\\cup[4,\\infty)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -23px\" width=\"209\" height=\"56\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28Answer_Choices.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(Answer_Choices)\">Solution 2 (Answer Choices)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (Answer Choices)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Like in solution 1, we can realise that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/8/ab8cb21651922efa9f65043000d8eedd6f946df4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3x - 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"53\" height=\"15\" /> can be greater than or equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> can be any value greater than or equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. Of the answer choices, the only ones that allow <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> as a value are C and D. However, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/1/d01743f98c7abb542e75161fa0b13c232e9d4bb2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{4}{3} \\times 3 - 4 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"111\" height=\"38\" />, which is less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. This eliminates answer choice D, leaving <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/8/1f8a04179d3b045ac00c5fc2e7bc92cf51b83920.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf {(C) } \\left(-\\infty,-\\frac{4}{3}\\right]\\cup[4,\\infty)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -23px\" width=\"209\" height=\"56\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest\">2025 TMTA Algebra I</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Answer_Key\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 16\">Problem 16</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 18\">Problem 18</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/w