_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_36\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 36\">36</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_37\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 37\">37</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_38\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 38\">38</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_39\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 39\">39</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_40\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 40\">40</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=TMTA_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_Past_Problems/Solutions\" title=\"TMTA High School Mathematics Contest Past Problems/Solutions\">All TMTA Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018033229\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.031 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.047 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 209/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 3897/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 606/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4185/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    8.084      1 Template:TMTA_box\n100.00%    8.084      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:37710:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018033229 and revision id 291637. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}